# PLAN-992 legacy-a2r certification extension — the five H-02 a2r-snapshot
# checks (B08/B11/R01/R03/R04) whose goldens were never frozen. a2r-ONLY by
# design: these rows' legacy-engine faces are engine-difference cells owned
# elsewhere; this suite adds exactly the daily a2r emit+byte-compare face
# that certification requires. The original 12 composite snapshot checks
# stay in legacy-composite.case.ad (single obligation, no duplication).
# Goldens frozen only after explicit per-source G04 semantic review; the
# explicit certification itself is the ace-certify tool (never this suite).

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.b08"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "a2r-cert-992"]
  links: ["PLAN-992"]
  source: { file: "src/B08.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "a2r-snapshot", adapter: "a2r", action: "emit", options: { module_name: "m1_b08" },
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [
        { path: "m1_b08.rs", file: "oracle/m1_b08.rs", compare: "bytes" } ] } }
  ]
}
```

